#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:280
msgid "Frame-buffer image loading *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Pemuatan citra ke buffer bingkai *(perilaku)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:282
msgid ""
"Functions that load an image into the frame buffer — :class:`image.Image` "
"with ``copy_to_fb=True``, :meth:`image.Image.copy` / "
":meth:`image.Image.scale` and the ``to_*`` conversions with "
"``copy_to_fb=True``, :meth:`image.ImageIO.read`, :func:`fir.snapshot` and "
":func:`tof.snapshot` with ``copy_to_fb=True`` — used to push the new image "
"to the IDE preview immediately, so anything drawn on the returned image was "
"never seen. They now mark the frame buffer as pending and flush it, with "
"everything drawn on it, right before the next image overwrites it — the same"
" behavior as :meth:`csi.CSI.snapshot`."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi-fungsi yang memuat citra ke buffer bingkai — :class:`image.Image` "
"dengan ``copy_to_fb=True``\\ , :meth:`image.Image.copy` / "
":meth:`image.Image.scale` dan konversi ``to_*`` dengan ``copy_to_fb=True``\\"
" , :meth:`image.ImageIO.read`\\ , :func:`fir.snapshot` dan "
":func:`tof.snapshot` dengan ``copy_to_fb=True`` — sebelumnya langsung "
"mendorong citra baru ke pratinjau IDE, sehingga apa pun yang digambar pada "
"citra yang dikembalikan tidak pernah terlihat. Kini fungsi-fungsi tersebut "
"menandai buffer bingkai sebagai tertunda dan mem-flush-nya, bersama semua "
"yang digambar di atasnya, tepat sebelum citra berikutnya menimpanya — "
"perilaku yang sama seperti :meth:`csi.CSI.snapshot`\\ ."

