#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:338
msgid ""
"None of this affects MicroPython scripts. ``py_image.c`` was split, with the"
" descriptor objects (cascade, keypoints, LBP, keypoint match) moving to "
"``py_image_descriptor.c`` and the statistics objects (similarity, "
"statistics, percentile, threshold, histogram) to ``py_image_stats.c``. The "
"imlib encoder API was aligned with the rest of imlib: ``jpeg_compress`` / "
"``png_compress`` return ``0`` on success and ``-1`` on error, and "
"``jpeg_compress`` lost its ``realloc`` argument (resizing is gated on buffer"
" ownership). ``OMV_PROTOCOL_MAX_CHANNELS`` became "
"``OMV_PROTOCOL_CHANNEL_MAX`` in ``omv_protocol_channel.h``, and ports now "
"call ``py_protocol_init0()`` on init. The ``OMV_PAG7936_MIPI_CSI2`` board "
"define is gone (the interface is selected at runtime). CI dependency bumps "
"and an empty-release-changelog fix round it out. See the `firmware "
"repository <https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ history for fork-relevant "
"detail."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada yang memengaruhi skrip MicroPython. ``py_image.c`` dipecah, dengan"
" objek deskriptor (cascade, keypoints, LBP, keypoint match) dipindahkan ke "
"``py_image_descriptor.c`` dan objek statistik (similarity, statistics, "
"percentile, threshold, histogram) ke ``py_image_stats.c``\\ . API encoder "
"imlib diselaraskan dengan bagian imlib lainnya: ``jpeg_compress`` / "
"``png_compress`` mengembalikan ``0`` jika berhasil dan ``-1`` jika error, "
"dan ``jpeg_compress`` kehilangan argumen ``realloc``\\ -nya (pengubahan "
"ukuran dibatasi oleh kepemilikan buffer). ``OMV_PROTOCOL_MAX_CHANNELS`` "
"menjadi ``OMV_PROTOCOL_CHANNEL_MAX`` di ``omv_protocol_channel.h``\\ , dan "
"port kini memanggil ``py_protocol_init0()`` saat init. Define papan "
"``OMV_PAG7936_MIPI_CSI2`` dihilangkan (antarmuka dipilih saat runtime). "
"Pembaruan dependensi CI dan perbaikan changelog rilis kosong melengkapinya. "
"Lihat riwayat `repositori firmware <https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ "
"untuk detail yang relevan bagi fork."

